{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的音乐感受描写不如X细密，尤其缺少对声部、音型、力度和情绪转折的逐步对应，部分音乐变化被概括成了较笼统的情绪词。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把人物每一步心理变化的原因、顾虑和前后联系说得更清楚，尤其是从害怕暴露心意、发现对方没有退开，到逐渐敢于承认喜欢，再到害怕失去却不愿收回感情，整条心理线更容易让普通观众跟上。X的关键词突出、感受提示丰富且有音乐时间上的对应，细腻度和扫读效率有优势，但大量短词之间的关系需要观众自行拼接，有些感受还存在重复。综合听音乐时实际能理解的人物故事和情感发展，我更倾向Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a20030d8-94eb-4239-b8f0-e84a12ed2866", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T224536711353Z", "elapsed_seconds": 40.735, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:46:17.446081+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5ae40eef515d0e8adeef13c4f81bbaba7d338ef9aa0b4f93058fb01a995933f2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chat